{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page","settings":{"show-title":false,"background-color":"none","light-text":false,"container-width":"4","spacing-above":false,"spacing-below":true}},"featured_text_i6g3jg":{"type":"featured-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"selector":"","top-border":false,"spacing-above":true,"spacing-below":true,"background-color":"none","light-text":false,"heading-type":"section-heading","container-width":"4","overline":"","heading":"Elevating Your Extraordinary","description":"","link-url":"\/","link-text":""}},"image_with_text_WqQdX6":{"type":"image-with-text","settings":{"top-border":false,"spacing-above":true,"spacing-below":false,"background-color":"light","container-width":"6","light-text":false,"overlap":false,"text-position":"overlay","heading-type":"section-heading","text-horizontal-alignment":"center","text-vertical-alignment":"center","text-width":"medium","text-style":"none","text-background-color":"light","image-display-type":"large","aspect-ratio":56,"overlay-style":"darken","parallax-enabled":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/memorize-trunks-our-story_0e2d09b2-2940-4b50-9cd7-db2ded4233dd.jpg","overline":"","title":"Why Memorize","description":"<p>We believe the moments that matter aren’t just photographed—they’re kept. Beyond the smiling photos, we honor the tangible keepsakes that tell your story—love letters, teeny tiny socks, paint-splattered art, first baseball gloves, communion crosses, and wedding shoes. Each Memorize Trunk is <strong>quilted to protect what matters<\/strong>—soft where it should be, structured where it counts—with a wide range of fabric aesthetics and custom embroidery that creates a <strong>signature home<\/strong> for what you’ll come back to again and again. Because <strong>legacy doesn’t have one look.<\/strong> <\/p>","link-url":"","link-text":"","mobile-overlay":false,"mobile-hide-description":false,"mobile-image-display-type":"original","mobile-aspect-ratio":116,"mobile-text-alignment":"bottom"}},"featured_text_Kfmr6K":{"type":"featured-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"selector":"","top-border":false,"spacing-above":false,"spacing-below":true,"background-color":"none","light-text":false,"heading-type":"section-heading","container-width":"4","overline":"WHY MEMORIZE","heading":"","description":"<p>Beyond smiling photos, capture the journey. Gather your hand-knitted sweaters, paint-splattered masterpieces, first baseball glove, communion cross, or even your wedding shoes. Celebrate your heartfelt moments with keepsake trunks as unique as the memories themselves. <\/p>","link-url":"\/","link-text":""}},"testimonials_3k3RA8":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonial_gMxAyY":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","author-role":"","author-name":"Make Space for the Moments that Shape You","description":"<p>We design storage that elevates your memories — never hidden in a plastic bin.<\/p>"}},"testimonial_f8hbLk":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","author-role":"","author-name":"Built to Last, Designed to Love","description":"<p>Quilted for softness and structure, tailored for a clean, elevated finish — made to be opened and reopened.<\/p>"}},"testimonial_yVRRmq":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","author-role":"","author-name":"We Are With You Every Step","description":"<p>Want help selecting from our range of fabrics? Thread colors? We’re here from start to finish. <em><strong>Message us!<\/strong><\/em><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["testimonial_gMxAyY","testimonial_f8hbLk","testimonial_yVRRmq"],"custom_css":[".testimonials--image {height: 56px; width: auto;}","[data-item~=\"block-heading\"] {font-size: 28px;}","img {display: block; -o-object-fit: cover; object-fit: contain; height: 100%; width: 100%; border-radius: var(--image--radius); overflow: hidden; transition: filter 0.25s linear;}","@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {[data-item~=\"block-heading\"] {font-size: 20px; }}",".testimonials--info {border: 1px solid #00334d; border-radius: 20px;}"],"settings":{"background-overlay-image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_58.png","top-border":false,"spacing-above":true,"spacing-below":true,"background-color":"none","light-text":false,"container-width":"4","image-shape":"natural","overline":"","heading":"Our Promises to You","mobile-width":"1"}},"image_with_text_zNhEMy":{"type":"image-with-text","custom_css":[".featured-content--root[data-text-position=\"left\"] .featured-content--image {min-width: 60%;}",",.featured-content--root[data-text-position=\"right\"] {min-width: 40%;}",".featured-content--image .featured-content--container {align-items: stretch !important;}"],"settings":{"top-border":false,"spacing-above":true,"spacing-below":true,"background-color":"accent-3","container-width":"4","light-text":false,"overlap":false,"text-position":"left","heading-type":"section-heading","text-horizontal-alignment":"center","text-vertical-alignment":"center","text-width":"medium","text-style":"none","text-background-color":"transparent","image-display-type":"medium","aspect-ratio":56,"overlay-style":"darken-bottom","parallax-enabled":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Memorize-Custom-Styled-Trunks-Our-Story-Slonim-family.jpg","overline":"","title":"How It Started","description":"<p>It started with a soccer jersey. My daughter’s first, stained with grass and sweat and pride and shoved into the back of her closet. It didn’t feel right.<\/p><p>That’s what inspired Memorize! Legacy doesn’t have one look—so we offer a range of fabric aesthetics, with quilted interiors and tailored construction that gives memories the care, structure, and finish they deserve. Every time you tuck something inside your memory box—a baby bracelet, a love note, a first-day outfit—your heart swells with joy.<\/p><p><em>XO,  <br\/>Gayle, founder & lifelong memory keeper<\/em><\/p>","link-url":"","link-text":"","mobile-overlay":false,"mobile-hide-description":false,"mobile-image-display-type":"medium","mobile-aspect